[h1]⭐ [THE ASCENSION ERA] - Cosmic War Update 3.0.0! ⭐[/h1]

[hr][/hr]

[h3]📡 What's New in The Ascension Era?[/h3]
War v3.0.0 unleashes the ultimate tactical arsenal! The AI is smarter, the sieges are deadlier, and the diplomacy simulation has been completely stabilized for massive multiplayer galaxies.

[b]⚠️ NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/b]
Due to the complete overhaul of faction diplomacy traits, you must start a new galaxy!

[hr][/hr]

✅ [b]NEW MECHANICS, FEATURES & CONTENT[/b]
[list]
[*]⚔️ [b]Dynamic Territory Expansion:[/b] The Galaxy Map is alive! Factions now dynamically siege, conquer, and permanently flip territory borders mathematically in the background without causing performance drain.
[*]🛡️ [b]Dreadnought Sieges & Scaling:[/b] Invasion fleets now mathematically scale to match 100% of the defender's volume and omicron! Massive Siege Dreadnoughts with 10x shield multipliers spearhead assaults.
[*]⚡ [b]Electronic Warfare:[/b] Invaders have a 35% chance to deploy an EMP Shield Jammer upon entering a sector, pinning ALL shields (including players) to 0 for a massive 60-second surprise attack window!
[*]🪐 [b]Planetary Defense Grids:[/b] Sectors equipped with Planetary Shields render all friendly stations 100% invincible to damage and electronic warfare until the generator is destroyed!
[*]🌩️ [b]Weather-Assisted Boarding:[/b] A siege occurring during a Dark Matter Fog or Ion Storm will natively slice the defending station's boarding defense multiplier by 50%!
[*]🎭 [b]9 Dynamic Faction Traits:[/b] Re-enabled dormant vanilla traits and added 5 new ones! Factions can spawn as 'Imperialist' (expanding borders), 'Entrenched' (building fortresses), 'Vengeful' (rejecting peace), or 'Mercantile' (paying 3x bounties).
[*]📉 [b]Deep Economy Warfare:[/b] Market collapses trigger desperation invasions! Factions with high Famine Scores will launch massive assaults on wealthy neighbors.
[*]🤝 [b]PvP & Alliance Integration:[/b] Reputation shifts are now actively mirrored onto the player's active Alliance! You can no longer swap to personal ships to commit war crimes without implicating your entire alliance.
[*]⚠️ [b]Weaponized Subspace Tears:[/b] At Critical War Heat, warring factions may detonate experimental subspace weapons, tearing space and unleashing localized Rift hazards.
[*]💼 [b]Dynamic War Contracts & Enlistment:[/b] Dock at Military Outposts to officially enlist as a privateer! Accept dynamically scaled contracts (e.g., Force Recon, Decapitation Strikes, Subspace Containment, Minefield Deployment).
[*]📜 [b]Warbonds:[/b] Purchase Warbonds from Trading Posts that dynamically mature when the geopolitical war state resolves.
[*]🔥 [b]War Zone Events:[/b] 5 new events added including Station Siege Blockades, Eclipse Vanguard Invasions, Capital Ship Duels, Distress Beacon Traps, and Orbital Bombardment.
[*]🖥️ [b]Cinematic Battlefield HUD:[/b] Active sieges feature a sleek Top-Screen Red/Blue bar HUD tracking live siege durations and dramatic border flips.
[*]📖 [b]Cosmic Codex Integration:[/b] Read all 11 combat event features, deep lore, and mechanic breakdowns natively in-game.
[/list]

⚙️ [b]CHANGED & BALANCED[/b]
[list]
[*]⚖️ [b]Famine & Siege Penalties:[/b] The base Famine Score penalty for losing a sector siege has been drastically reduced (+20 down to +5) to prevent instant economic cascade failures. Defending with a Commodore captain further reduces this to +2.
[*]💰 [b]Contract Payout Buffs:[/b] Base payouts for all War Contracts significantly buffed. Completing missions for 'Mercantile' factions grants a 3x bonus payout! However, abandoning contracts now incurs massive reputation hits.
[*]⏱️ [b]Galactic Turn Synchronization:[/b] Diplomacy, news, sanctions, and bounty intervals are strictly aligned to 20 minutes to process seamlessly during a synchronized "Galactic Turn" for massive TPS improvements.
[*]🚑 [b]Refugee Crisis Buff:[/b] Refugee Freighters now scale with a massive invisible 10x shield/durability buff to survive pirate assaults long enough for you to intercept and rescue them.
[*]🎙️ [b]Centralized Radio Chatter:[/b] All custom ambient lore and war chatter lines seamlessly migrated to Cosmic Chronicles to prevent duplicate hooks.
[*]🔗 [b]Core Dependencies:[/b] Core 5 mods (including Cosmic Vault) are now hard requirements for maximum stability.
[/list]

🐛 [b]STABILITY, BUG FIXES & OPTIMIZATION[/b]
[list]
[*]⚡ [b]Massive Fleet Performance Scaling:[/b] Heavily reduced background tick frequency on 6 War-specific contracts and throttled 5 major mission scripts. Drastically reduces CPU overhead on busy multiplayer servers!
[*]🔒 [b]Diplomacy Thread Safety (CRITICAL):[/b] Background diplomacy threads are fully synchronized on the main thread, permanently eliminating `EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION` server hangs during massive sector relation updates!
[*]💥 [b]Engine Crash Fixes:[/b] Fixed multiple Avorion API Indexes that caused C++ crashes (corrected stat modifiers, invalid faction setters, removed native calls to non-existent functions).
[*]🛡️ [b]Hardened Faction Relations:[/b] Migrated 15+ mission/event scripts to use the Vault's hardened relations API, removing dangerous fallback logic that crashed the engine on boundary overflows.
[*]🤝 [b]Multiplayer Synchronization:[/b] Replaced all `math.random` instances with deterministic engine logic to prevent massive client/server desyncs when generating loot, stats, and enemies.
[*]👻 [b]Ghost AI Bug Fix:[/b] Fixed a critical issue where Flagships spawned during events lacked behavior scripts. They now properly inject the new Dreadnought boss AI.
[*]🐞 [b]Mission & Trigger Logic Fixes:[/b] Fixed soft-locks in Force Recon generation, properly advancing Minefield deployment counters, and fixed Propaganda broadcasts evaluating too frequently.
[*]🧮 [b]UI & Truthiness Logic Fixes:[/b] Stabilized the Galactic Politics UI by applying strict float comparisons for sorting. Faction names will no longer display raw translator comments.
[*]📂 [b]VFS & Architecture Flaws:[/b] Stripped redundant global wrappers and fixed a critical flaw where `cosmicwartraits.lua` exposed a global wrapper preventing vanilla server initialization.
